    "description": "Analysis of temperature, humidity, wind, pressure, radiation, pollen concentration and other meteorological variables at 1 km grid resolution, generated by the KENDA-CH1 data assimilation system. The dataset also includes KENDA-CH1 1-hour First Guess estimates for precipitation, radiation and other variables. Analyses and First Guess estimates are updated hourly and are available for the last 24 hours.",
